  fiber system with a LINE engine is z-linear+affine ⟹ fiber degree of
  the reduced curve system = 1 ⟹ Keller line-engine maps are BIRATIONAL
  ⟹ invertible (Keller 1939): LINE ENGINES CANNOT GIVE COUNTEREXAMPLES.
